{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u6_prose_classics", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thanjavur_big_temple", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தஞ்சைப் பெரிய கோயில் தொடர்பான கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(i) இக்கோயிலைக் கட்டியவர் முதலாம் இராஜராஜ சோழன்.\n(ii) கோயிலின் விமானம் 216 அடி உயரம் கொண்டது; இதன் விமானக் கலசம் ஒற்றைக் கல்லால் ஆனது.\n(iii) இக்கோயிலின் தலைமைச் சிற்பி குஞ்சரமல்லன் இராஜராஜப் பெருந்தச்சன் என்று கல்வெட்டு கூறுகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(i) மற்றும் (ii) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(i), (ii), (iii) ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி", "C": "(ii) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "(i) மட்டுமே சரி"}, "explanation": "தஞ்சைப் பெரிய கோயில் முதலாம் இராஜராஜ சோழனால் கட்டப்பட்டது. 216 அடி உயர விமானம், 80 டன் ஒற்றைக் கல் கலசம், தலைமைச் சிற்பி குஞ்சரமல்லன் இராஜராஜப் பெருந்தச்சன் பெயர்கள் கல்வெட்டுகளில் தெளிவாகப் பொறிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding Thanjavur Brihadisvara Temple:\n(i) Built by Raja Raja Chola I.\n(ii) The vimana is 216 feet high; its stupi consists of a single block.\n(iii) Inscriptions name Kunjaramallan Rajaraja Perunthachan as chief architect.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only (i) and (ii) are correct", "B": "All (i), (ii), and (iii) are correct", "C": "Only (ii) and (iii) are correct", "D": "Only (i) is correct"}, "explanation": "All statements are historically and epigraphically accurate regarding the Brihadisvara Temple built by Raja Raja Chola I."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 145, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 145", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Thanjavur Temple", "Architecture"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u6_prose_classics", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kutrala_kuravanji", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி பாத்திரங்களை அவற்றின் தன்மையோடு பொருத்துக:\n(a) வசந்தவல்லி - 1. குறவஞ்சி ஜோதிடம் சொல்பவள்\n(b) சிங்கன் - 2. உலா வரும் தலைவன் மீது காதல் கொண்ட தலைவி\n(c) சிங்கி - 3. பறவை பிடிக்கும் வேடன்\n(d) நூவன் - 4. சிங்கனின் தோழன்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-3, c-2, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2"}, "explanation": "வசந்தவல்லி குறவஞ்சியின் தலைவி (2), சிங்கன் பறவை பிடிக்கும் வேடன் (3), சிங்கி குறத்தி சோதிடம் சொல்பவள் (1), நூவன் சிங்கனின் தோழன் (4)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the characters of Kutrala Kuravanji:\n(a) Vasanthavalli - 1. Fortune teller\n(b) Singan - 2. Heroine loving the deity\n(c) Singi - 3. Bird catcher\n(d) Nuvan - 4. Singan's friend", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-3, c-2, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2"}, "explanation": "Vasanthavalli is the heroine (2), Singan is the fowler (3), Singi is the fortune-teller (1), Nuvan is Singan's confidant (4)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 130, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 130", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Kutrala Kuravanji", "Literature"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q004", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u6_prose_classics", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thiruchazhal_manikkavasagar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருச்சாழல் எந்தத் திருமுறையில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது? இதனை அருளிச்செய்தவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏழாம் திருமுறை - சுந்தரர்", "B": "ஒன்பதாம் திருமுறை - சேந்தனார்", "C": "பன்னிரண்டாம் திருமுறை - சேக்கிழார்", "D": "எட்டாம் திருமுறை (திருவாசகம்) - மாணிக்கவாசகர்"}, "explanation": "திருச்சாழல் என்பது எட்டாம் திருமுறையான திருவாசகத்தில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள பதிகமாகும். இதனை அருளிச்செய்தவர் மாணிக்கவாசகர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which Thirumurai is Thiruchazhal included, and who authored it?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "7th Thirumurai - Sundarar", "B": "9th Thirumurai - Sendhanar", "C": "12th Thirumurai - Sekkizhar", "D": "8th Thirumurai (Thiruvasagam) - Manikkavasagar"}, "explanation": "Thiruchazhal is part of Thiruvasagam in the 8th Thirumurai, composed by Manikkavasagar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page