{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q066", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_leaders_epic", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tamil_thai_valthu_pothigai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நீராருங் கடலுடுத்த...’ தமிழ்த்தாய் வாழ்த்துப் பாடலில் தமிழ்மொழி எந்த மலையின் மேன்மையோடு ஒப்பிடப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இமயமலை", "B": "பொதியமலை (தென்திசை)", "C": "விந்தியமலை", "D": "மேரு மலை"}, "explanation": "‘தெக்கணமும் அதிற்சிறந்த திராவிடநல் திருநாடும்... தக்கணமும் அதிற்சிறந்த தென்திசை பொதியமலை...’ எனப் பொதியமலையின் தமிழ் மணத்தைப் போற்றுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Tamil Thai Valthu, Tamil's fame is linked with which divine Southern mountain?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Himalayas", "B": "Pothigai Malai (Southern peak)", "C": "Vindhyas", "D": "Meru Mountain"}, "explanation": "The hymn specifically celebrates the sweet southern fragrance of Tamil blossoming from the sacred Pothigai mountains."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 200, "chapter": null, "section": null, "refere