{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q069", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_leaders_epic", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "manonmaniam_university", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மனோன்மணீயம் சுந்தரனாரின் நினைவைப் போற்றும் வகையில் தமிழக அரசால் எந்தப் பல்கலைக்கழகம் நிறுவப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மனோன்மணியம் சுந்தரனார் பல்கலைக்கழகம் (திருநெல்வேலி)", "B": "பாரதிதாசன் பல்கலைக்கழகம் (திருச்சி)", "C": "அழகப்பா பல்கலைக்கழகம் (காரைக்குடி)", "D": "தமிழ் பல்கலைக்கழகம் (தஞ்சாவூர்)"}, "explanation": "பேராசிரியர் சுந்தரனாரின் தமிழ்த்தொண்டைப் போற்றும் வகையில் 1990-இல் திருநெல்வேலியில் மனோன்மணியம் சுந்தரனார் பல்கலைக்கழகம் நிறுவப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which university was established by the Government of Tamil Nadu to perpetuate the memory of Manonmaniam Sundaranar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Manonmaniam Sundaranar University (Tirunelveli)", "B": "Bharathidasan University (Tiruchirappalli)", "C": "Alagappa University (Karaikudi)", "D": "Tamil University (Thanjavur)"}, "explanation": "Manonmaniam Sundaranar University was founded in Tirunelveli in 1990 in tribute to his scholarly legacy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 201, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 201", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Sundaranar", "University"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q070", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_leaders_epic", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_education_philosophy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தாகூரின் கல்விச் சிந்தனை நான்கு சுவர்களுக்குள் அடங்கும் தேர்வு மையக் கல்வியை வன்மையாக எதிர்த்தது.\nகாரணம் (R): இயற்கைச் சூழலில் மரத்தடியில் அமர்ந்து மனிதனை இயற்கையோடும் உலகளாவிய மனிதநேயத்தோடும் இணைப்பதே உண்மையான கல்வி என்று அவர் நம்பினார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "B": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்", "C": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி", "D": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "தாகூர் சாந்திநிகேதனில் திறந்தவெளிப் பள்ளியை அமைத்தது கூண்டுக் கிளி போன்ற சிறைப்பட்ட கல்விமுறையிலிருந்து குழந்தைகளை விடுவிக்கவே ஆகும். எனவே கூற்றும் காரணமும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Tagore's philosophy of education strongly rejected examination-driven schooling confined within four walls.\nReason (R): He believed true education lies in learning under trees amidst nature, fostering universal humanism.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "Both (A) and (R) are true; and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Tagore founded Shantiniketan specifically to free young minds from regimented institutional education, harmonizing study with nature."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 196, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 196", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Tagore", "Education"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q071", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_leaders_epic", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "bharathidasan_eliya_nadai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘எளிய நடையில் தமிழ்நூல் எழுதிடவும் வேண்டும்... இலக்கண நூல் புதிதாக இயற்றுதலும் வேண்டும்’ என்று பாடியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாரதியார்", "B": "நாமக்கல் கவிஞர்", "C": "பாரதிதாசன்", "D": "வாணிதாசன்"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் மொழியின் புதுமைக்கும் அறிவியல் வளர்ச்சிக்கும் எளிய நடையில் புது நூல்களும் புதிய இலக்கண நூல்களும் வேண்டும் என்று பாரதிதாசன் முழங்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who declared the imperative 'Eliya nadaiyil Thamizh nool ezhuthidavum vendum... Ilakkana nool puthidhaaga iyattruthalum vendum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Subramania Bharati", "B": "Namakkal Kavignar", "C": "Bharathidasan", "D": "Vanidasan"}, "explanation": "Bharathidasan composed these famous lines calling for accessible Tamil literature and modern grammatical renewal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "