{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q086", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_sangam_modern_theatre", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "inquilab_real_name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஒவ்வொரு புல்லையும் பெயர் சொல்லி அழைப்பேன்’ என்ற புகழ்பெற்ற கவிதைத் தொகுப்பின் ஆசிரியர் இன்குலாப்பின் இயற்பெயர் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அப்துல் ரகுமான்", "B": "சாகுல் அமீது", "C": "மீரா", "D": "இராசேந்திரன்"}, "explanation": "மக்கள் கவிஞர் இன்குலாப்பின் இயற்பெயர் சாகுல் அமீது ஆகும். இவர் கீழக்கரையில் பிறந்த புரட்சிக் கவிஞர் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the real name of people's poet Inquilab, author of 'Ovvoru Pullaiyum Peyar Solli Azhaippen'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Abdul Rahman", "B": "Shahul Hameed", "C": "Meera", "D": "Rajendran"}, "explanation": "People's poet Inquilab's real name was Shahul Hameed, born in Keelakarai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 205, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 205", "url": null, "sour