{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q114", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "narthaki_nataraj_guru", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் யாரிடம் தஞ்சாவூர் பாணி பரதநாட்டியத்தை குருகுல முறையில் பயின்றார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ருக்மிணி தேவி அருண்டேல்", "B": "தஞ்சை கே. பி. கிட்டப்பா பிள்ளை", "C": "வழுவூர் பி. இராமையா பிள்ளை", "D": "பத்மா சுப்பிரமணியம்"}, "explanation": "நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் தஞ்சாவூர் நால்வர் மரபில் வந்த புகழ்பெற்ற நட்டுவனார் கே. பி. கிட்டப்பா பிள்ளையிடம் 15 ஆண்டுகள் குருகுல முறையில் பயின்றார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under which legendary maestro did Narthaki Nataraj train in the authentic Thanjavur Bani of Bharatanatyam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Rukmini Devi Arundale", "B": "Thanjavur K. P. Kittappa Pillai", "C": "Vazhuvoor B. Ramaiyah Pillai", "D": "Padma Subrahmanyam"}, "explanation": "She trained for 15 intense years under the doyen of the Thanjavur Quartet tradition, K. P. Kittappa Pillai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 215, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 215", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Narthaki Nataraj", "Guru"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q115", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "proofreading_symbols_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மெய்ப்புத் திருத்தக் குறியீடுகளையும் அவற்றின் பயன்பாட்டையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) Dele (இலத்தீன் நீக்கல் குறியீடு) - 1. தேவையற்ற எழுத்து அல்லது சொல்லை நீக்குக\n(b) Caret (^) - 2. விடுபட்ட எழுத்து அல்லது சொல்லைச் சேர்க்க\n(c) Stet - 3. நீக்கியதை மீண்டும் அப்படியே வைக்க (முன்போல இருக்க)\n(d) Transpose (tr) - 4. எழுத்து அல்லது சொல் வரிசை மாற்றுக", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Dele என்பது நீக்கல் (1), Caret என்பது சேர்த்தல் (2), Stet என்பது முன்போலவே இருக்க (3), Transpose என்பது இடமாற்றுக (4). நேர் பொருத்தம் a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the proofreading marks with their editorial functions:\n(a) Dele - 1. Delete unwanted letter/word\n(b) Caret (^) - 2. Insert missing character/word\n(c) Stet - 3. Let it stand (cancel previous deletion)\n(d) Transpose (tr) - 4. Transpose word/letter order", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Standard universal proofreading markup definitions: Dele (delete), Caret (insert), Stet (retain), Transpose (swap)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 220, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 220", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Proofreading", "Symbols"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q116", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aakkappeyar_definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஆக்கப்பெயர்’ (Derivative Noun) என்பது எவ்வகைச் சொற்களைக் குறிக்கும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொன்றுதொட்டு வழங்கும் இடுகுறிப் பெயர்கள் மட்டுமே", "B": "காரணப் பெயர்கள் மட்டுமே", "C": "வினையெச்சங்கள் மட்டுமே", "D": "ஒரு சொல்லோடு முன்னொட்டோ அல்லது பின்னொட்டோ சேர்த்துப் புதிதாக உருவாக்கப்படும் பெயர்ச்சொற்கள்"}, "explanation": "பெயர் அல்லது வினைச் சொற்களோடு பின்னொட்டுகள் (Suffixes) அல்லது முன்னொட்டுகள் சேர்ந்து புதிய சொற்களை ஆக்குவது 'ஆக்கப்பெயர்' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What constitutes a 'Derivative Noun' (Aakkappeyar) in Tamil linguistics?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Solely ancient arbitrary traditional nouns", "B": "Solely simple causal nouns", "C": "Solely adverbial participles", "D": "Nouns newly coined by attaching derivational prefixes or suffixes to root words"}, "explanation": "Aakkappeyar designates derived nouns forged through affixation of nominalizing bound morphemes."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publ