{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q117", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aakkappeyar_examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘காரன், காரி’ போன்ற பின்னொட்டுகள் சேர்ந்து உருவாகும் ஆக்கப்பெயர்களுக்குப் பொருத்தமான சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வண்டிக்காரன், தோட்டக்காரி, வீட்டுக்காரன்", "B": "மரம், செடி, கொடி", "C": "படித்தான், எழுதினான்", "D": "பெரியவன், சிறியவன்"}, "explanation": "வண்டி + காரன் = வண்டிக்காரன்; தோட்டம் + காரி = தோட்டக்காரி என உடமை, தொழில் உணர்த்தும் 'காரன், காரி' பின்னொட்டுகளால் ஆக்கப்பெயர்கள் உருவாகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which set illustrates derivative nouns formed using agentive suffixes 'Kaaran' and 'Kaari'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vandikkaaran, Thottakkaari, Veettukkaaran", "B": "Maram, Sedi, Kodi", "C": "Padithaan, Ezhuthinaan", "D": "Periyavan, Siriyavan"}, "explanation": "Kaaran and Kaari serve as productive nominalizer suffixes denoting agency, profession, or ownership."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 191, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 191", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Aakkappeyar", "Suffixes"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q118", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "narthaki_nataraj_accomplishments", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் பற்றிய கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(i) இவர் மதுரை மாநகரில் பிறந்தார்; சிறுவயது முதல் நாட்டியத்தில் பேரார்வம் கொண்டார்.\n(ii) இவரது கலைப்பணியைப் பாராட்டி தமிழ்நாடு அரசு கலைமாமணி விருது வழங்கிக் கௌரவித்தது.\n(iii) இவர் தமிழ்நாடு மாநிலத் திட்டக்குழு உறுப்பினராகவும் நியமிக்கப்பட்ட பெருமை பெற்றவர்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(i) மற்றும் (ii) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(i), (ii), (iii) ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி", "C": "(ii) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "(i) மட்டுமே சரி"}, "explanation": "நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் மதுரையில் பிறந்தவர், கலைமாமணி, பத்மஸ்ரீ பெற்றவர், மாநில திட்டக்குழு உறுப்பினராகப் பணியாற்றிய பெருமைக்குரியவர். அனைத்தும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements on Narthaki Nataraj:\n(i) Born in Madurai, passionate about classical dance from childhood.\n(ii) Honored with the Kalaimamani award by the Tamil Nadu Government.\n(iii) Appointed as a member of the Tamil Nadu State Planning Commission.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only (i) and (ii) are correct", "B": "All (i), (ii), and (iii) are correct", "C": "Only (ii) and (iii) are correct", "D": "Only (i) is correct"}, "explanation": "All listed accomplishments accurately chronicle the trailblazing life of Narthaki Nataraj."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 216, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 216", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Narthaki Nataraj", "Achievements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
