{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q127", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aakkappeyar_iyal_suffix", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இயல்’ என்னும் அறிவியல்/கலை பின்னொட்டு பெற்று வரும் ஆக்கப்பெயர்களுக்குப் பொருத்தமான சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மரம், கல்", "B": "பெரிது, சிறிது", "C": "மொழியியல், வானியல், உளவியல், உயிரியல்", "D": "நடந்தான், வந்தான்"}, "explanation": "மொழி + இயல் = மொழியியல்; வான் + இயல் = வானியல் எனத் துறையைக் குறிக்கும் பின்னொட்டாக 'இயல்' அமைந்து ஆக்கப்பெயர்களை உருவாக்குகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which terms illustrate academic disciplines coined using the systemic suffix '-Iyal'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Maram, Kal", "B": "Perithu, Sirithu", "C": "Mozhiyiyal, Vaaniyal, Ulaviyal, Uyiriyal", "D": "Nadanthaan, Vanthaan"}, "explanation": "The suffix '-Iyal' creates disciplinary nouns analogous to the Greek '-logy' or '-ics'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 191, "chapter": null, "section"