{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q128", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_kudi_seyalvagai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஆள்வினையும் ஆன்ற அறிவும் எனஇரண்டின்\nநீள்வினையால் நீளும் குடி’ - இக்குறட்பாவில் ‘ஆள்வினை’ என்பது எதனைக் குறிக்கும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மன்னன் இடும் கட்டளை", "B": "விதிப்பயன்", "C": "பகைமை உணர்வு", "D": "விடாமுயற்சி (விடாமுயற்சியோடு கூடிய உழைப்பு)"}, "explanation": "இக்குறளில் ‘ஆள்வினை’ என்பது சோம்பலின்றித் தொடர்ந்து உழைக்கும் 'விடாமுயற்சி'யைக் குறிக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the chapter on Uplifting One's Family (Kudi Seyalvagai), what does the term 'Aalvinai' signify?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Royal decree", "B": "Fate or destiny", "C": "Hostile sentiment", "D": "Unyielding perseverance and dedicated industrious effort"}, "explanation": "'Aalvinai' strictly denotes relentless human industry, perseverance, and diligent labor."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 225, "cha