{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q132", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u7_u8_interview_proof_names", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_nandriyil_selvam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நச்சப் படாதவன் செல்வம் நடுவூருள்\nநச்சு மரம்பழுத் தற்று’ - இக்குறட்பாவில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "B": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "C": "பிறிது மொழிதல் அணி", "D": "உவமை அணி"}, "explanation": "பிறருக்கு உதவாத உலோபியின் செல்வத்தை நடுவூரில் பழுத்த நச்சு மரத்தோடு ஒப்பிட்டு 'அற்று' என்னும் உவம உருபு வெளிப்பட்டு வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'உவமை அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which poetic figure of speech (Ani) is deployed in the Thirukkural on unshared wealth (Nandriyil Selvam)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vetttrumai Ani", "B": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani", "C": "Pirithu Mozhithal Ani", "D": "Uvamai Ani (Simile)"}, "explanation": "Because the miser's wealth is explicitly compared to a poisonous tree fruiting in the village center using the particle 'attru', it is Uvamai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "1