{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q149", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar_identification", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u8_grammar_mega_test", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mayangoli_differentiation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘பணி’ மற்றும் ‘பனி’ ஆகிய மயங்கொலிச் சொற்களின் சரியான பொருள் வேறுபாட்டைத் தேர்க:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பணி = வேலை/வணக்கம் ; பனி = குளிர்/பனித்துளி", "B": "பணி = குளிர் ; பனி = வேலை", "C": "பணி = உணவு ; பனி = நீர்", "D": "பணி = மலை ; பனி = கடல்"}, "explanation": "டண்ணகர 'பணி' என்பது வேலை, தொண்டு, வணக்கம் ஆகியவற்றைக் குறிக்கும்; றன்னகர 'பனி' என்பது குளிர்ந்த பனித்துளி அல்லது குளிர்காலத்தைக் குறிக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the correct semantic distinction between homophones 'Pani' (ண) and 'Pani' (ன):", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pani (ண) = Work / Bowing ; Pani (ன) = Dew / Cold fog", "B": "Pani (ண) = Cold ; Pani (ன) = Work", "C": "Pani (ண) = Food ; Pani (ன) = Water", "D": "Pani (ண) = Mountain ; Pani (ன) = Ocean"}, "explanation": "Pani (retroflex ண) means work or subservience; Pani (alveolar ன) means snow, dew, or cold."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services C