{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q161", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar_identification", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u8_grammar_mega_test", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aakkappeyar_valar_suffix", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘வாணர்’ என்னும் பின்னொட்டால் உருவாக்கப்படும் ஆக்கப்பெயருக்குச் சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நகரவாணர், காட்டுவாணர், உலகவாணர்", "B": "படிப்பகம்", "C": "வண்டிக்காரன்", "D": "தோட்டக்காரி"}, "explanation": "நகரம் + வாணர் = நகரவாணர் (நகரத்தில் வாழ்பவர்); காடு + வாணர் = காட்டுவாணர் என வசிப்பிடத்தைக் குறிக்கும் 'வாணர்' பின்னொட்டு ஆக்கப்பெயர்களை அமைக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which words represent derivative nominals carrying the habitational suffix '-Vaanar' (dwellers)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nagaravaanar, Kaattuvaanar, Ulagavaanar", "B": "Padippagam", "C": "Vandikkaaran", "D": "Thottakkaari"}, "explanation": "The archaic bound nominalizer '-Vaanar' productively denotes inhabitants or residents."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 191, "chapter": null, "section": null, "refere