{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q162", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar_identification", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u8_grammar_mega_test", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mayangoli_ara_ara", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அறம்’ மற்றும் ‘அரம்’ ஆகிய சொற்களின் சரியான பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அறம் = இரும்பை அறுக்கும் கருவி ; அரம் = தருமம்", "B": "அறம் = தருமம்/நற்செயல் ; அரம் = இரும்பை அல்லது மரத்தைத் தேய்க்கும் கருவி", "C": "அறம் = நீர் ; அரம் = காற்று", "D": "அறம் = மலை ; அரம் = காடு"}, "explanation": "வல்லின 'ற' அமைந்த 'அறம்' என்பது தருமம், ஒழுக்கம்; இடையின 'ர' அமைந்த 'அரம்' என்பது இரும்பு, மரத்தைத் தேய்த்துச் சீராக்கும் கருவியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Distinguish the semantic meaning of homophones 'Aram' (ற) and 'Aram' (ர):", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Aram (ற) = File tool ; Aram (ர) = Virtue", "B": "Aram (ற) = Moral virtue / Dharma ; Aram (ர) = Rasp / Metal filing file", "C": "Aram = Water ; Aram = Air", "D": "Aram = Mountain ; Aram = Forest"}, "explanation": "Aram with alveolar ற means virtue/righteousness; Aram with medial ர means a filing/sharpening rasp tool."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textboo