{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q164", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u8_grammar_mega_test", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "theatrical_terms_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நாடகவியல் கலைச்சொற்களைப் பொருத்துக:\n(a) Tragedy - 1. துன்பியல் நாடகம்\n(b) Comedy - 2. இன்பியல் நாடகம்\n(c) Dialogue - 3. உரையாடல்\n(d) Monologue - 4. தனிமொழி (தனிப்பேச்சு)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "Tragedy = துன்பியல் நாடகம் (1), Comedy = இன்பியல் நாடகம் (2), Dialogue = உரையாடல் (3), Monologue = தனிமொழி (4). நேர் பொருத்தம் a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match dramatic art technical terms with their recognized Tamil translations:\n(a) Tragedy - 1. Thunbiyal Natagam\n(b) Comedy - 2. Inbiyal Natagam\n(c) Dialogue - 3. Uraiyaadal\n(d) Monologue - 4. Thanimozhi (Soliloquy)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "Standard dramatic genres and performance vocabulary in Tamil theatrical studies."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Na